1. Worklist bridge (bridge/Dockerfile, image bethesda-pacs-worklist-bridge)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Installed with pip into the official python:3.12-slim image (Debian based):

  Package              Version            Licence
  pydicom              2.4.4 (pinned)     MIT-style (pydicom licence)
  requests             2.32.3 (pinned)    Apache-2.0
    certifi            as pip resolves    MPL-2.0 (file-level copyleft; used unmodified)
    urllib3            as pip resolves    MIT
    idna               as pip resolves    BSD-3-Clause
    charset-normalizer as pip resolves    MIT

  Python               3.12               PSF License (in the base image)
